WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.910
Picture three front doors on one street.

2
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.940
Behind the first, two mums and their son.

3
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:09.380
Behind the second, a
single dad with twin girls.

4
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:14.510
Behind the third, grandparents,
parents and cousins share one home.

5
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.500
Scripture tells children: honour
your father and your mother.

6
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:23.670
So with so many shapes of family,
what makes a family a family?

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.990
In this mission, you'll sort
real families into types,

8
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.880
from nuclear to blended.

9
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.250
Then you'll find out what
believers say families are for,

10
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.100
and where they disagree.

11
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.600
Your mission: find out what
makes a family a family,

12
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.390
and where believers disagree.
